          "title": "Eighty-Three",
          "subtitle": "Trick-taking",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "83: trick-taking game; first to 83 points (or similar target) wins. Trump and follow-suit rules; point cards in tricks. Exact rules vary by region (e.g. Indian 83)."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "American Pedro family; 83 played with 53 cards (52 + joker). Joker = lowest trump worth 15; trump 3 worth 0. North-east USA and Canada; same deal/bid as 63."
            }
          ]
        },
